msgstr "Izvleci arhive varnostnih kopij"

#: templates/wp-admin/settings/tab-extract.php:9
msgid "Select backup files to decrypt, decompress and extract in one step: encrypted (.crypt, .age), tar archives (plain, .gz or .zst), single .gz or .zst files, or a zip that holds them. Several files come back as one uncompressed zip. Everything happens entirely in your browser; files, passphrases and private keys are never uploaded. Keep this tab open until your downloads finish."
msgstr "Izberite datoteke varnostnih kopij za dešifriranje, razširitev in izvlečenje v enem koraku: šifrirane (.crypt, .age), arhive tar (navadne, .gz ali .zst), posamezne datoteke .gz ali .zst ali zip, ki jih vsebuje. Več datotek se vrne kot ena nestisnjena datoteka zip. Vse poteka v celoti v vašem brskalniku; datoteke, gesla in zasebni ključi se nikoli ne naložijo. Ta zavihek naj ostane odprt, dokler se prenosi ne končajo."

